2.1 - 2026-10-11
-------------------
* Multilingual UI: English, Korean, Japanese, Simplified and Traditional Chinese; chosen automatically from the browser language and changeable in Settings
* New Settings menu: language, light/dark/system theme, stone color mode, display options, keyboard shortcut reference
* Redesigned, general-purpose site layout for desktop and mobile, with light and dark themes
* Accessibility: keyboard play with a board cursor, screen reader announcements, visible focus, WCAG AA contrast, reduced-motion support, no axe-core violations
* Game record slider, confirmation before discarding a game, SGF errors shown in the selected language
* New favicon; the footer shows the app version

2.0 - 2026-10-11
-------------------
* Rewritten from scratch in TypeScript + Vite; jQuery, requirejs and Express removed, no runtime dependencies
* Rules engine: captures, suicide prevention, simple ko
* SGF open/save, game record playback, area scoring, pass, 9/13/19 boards
* SVG board, responsive layout, touch support, dark mode
* Deployed as a static site on GitHub Pages
* Removed AdSense, the Chrome app (crx) and the server code
* Options saved by the previous version in localStorage are not migrated

1.1 - 2020-09-08
-------------------
* jQuery upgraded from 1.8.0 to 1.12.4 (CDN)
* Google AdSense script added
* Updated AUTHORS; removed the Eclipse project file

1.0 - 2020-07-02
-------------------
* Express upgraded (body-parser, method-override and errorhandler as separate packages)
* Renamed "badook" to "baduk" everywhere, including the Chrome app manifest

0.6 - 2014-04-04
-------------------
* English UI, wood pattern board background, responsive board width
* AdSense removed again; README rewritten

0.5 - 2013-11-26
-------------------
* Heroku deployment (Procfile); board API reworked to (boardSize, gridCount)
* Resize buttons, orientation change handling; AdSense added

0.4 - 2013-06-06
-------------------
* Move back, show/hide stones, message module, stone size scales with the board

0.3 - 2013-06-04
-------------------
* RequireJS modules: board.js split into board, event and option modules

0.2 - 2013-06-03
-------------------
* Ported from Google App Engine to Node.js + Express 3

0.1 - 2013-05-02
-------------------
* Initial import of the original "badook" project (Google App Engine, canvas board)

Versions 0.1 - 1.1 were backfilled on 2026-10-11 from the git history; see the GitHub releases for details.
